{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "4b15108d479842c3c2f2561cc52a5d604dbd65242b4bbf7c6d363fb1bcfe31a3", "ja": "エミリーちゃん。悩みがあるなら話してみない？\n茜ちゃんが相談にのるよ？", "zh": "艾米莉。要是有什么烦恼，不如说出来听听？\n小茜可以听你倾诉哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "b11fe705bca036f88b5e16ac9a124af8db8d6adb458b78d4fa556475beed8ef9", "ja": "そ、そうだよー。宿題はあとでするから、\n私もエミリーちゃんの話、聞きたい！", "zh": "对、对呀——我待会儿再做作业，所以我也想听听艾米莉的烦恼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "89e91a9ad3bad2ebe7314439504c1c6b908583b762224e0501f32647658eb5fc", "ja": "お二人とも……ありがとうございます。\nその、たいしたことではないのですが……。", "zh": "两位……谢谢你们。那个，其实不是什么大不了的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "30d3e0be38f8283b9e0cb4fe8c4d139c3c6394cb3954919576a6fbf82e2fdc64", "ja": "先日街角で、海外から観光にきた方々を取材するお仕事\nをしていた時に……英国からきた方と出会ったんです。", "zh": "前些天在街头做采访海外游客的工作时……遇到了一位来自英国的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "7bc00a0711e74a4ced27d2042732aeb28d65e2899fbaccb7d77441d29b311caa", "ja": "おお、エミリーちゃんと同じ国の人！\nあれ？　それって嬉しいことじゃないの？", "zh": "哦，是和艾米莉来自同一个国家的人！\n咦？那不是件值得高兴的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "be8188db87901ed2239667383abf10915c42315f7d6acfdcfd97418d4d65f68d", "ja": "嬉しかったです！　それで、知っている限りの\n日本の魅力をお伝えしようと、はりきったのですが……", "zh": "我很开心！于是，我兴致勃勃地想把自己所知道的日本魅力都介绍给对方，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "ff06b45afa3fc1807e9b123d2ef0864f793d55e3af52c92c893200678dda5ab6", "ja": "私がはしゃぎ過ぎたせいで、\nご気分を害されてしまって……ううう。", "zh": "都怪我太兴奋了，\n结果让对方不高兴了……呜呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "a6ca014ec3f3d95c4015b57d8c6311f68ad7a49bf7239d9a24212035928b9c1c", "ja": "ハニャ？　観光客に日本を説明したんでしょ？\nなんで怒られちゃうの？", "zh": "哈呀？你不是在向游客介绍日本吗？\n为什么会被人责怪呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "3e9c0f347cf4ef9bb5375622a72f39e72acca8126b82712d64360003dd9c143f", "ja": "その方は私に、英国には魅力がないということか、と。\nそう言って、たいそうお怒りに……。", "zh": "那位客人对我说，难道我的意思是英国没有魅力吗？  \n说完这话后，便非常生气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "e91e455e5963d2d31533b1f245c4f99ff8ee87eb740b3dca31793381b331cd76", "ja": "えー、そんなこと言われたの！？\nなんか、ひどーい！", "zh": "诶——居然被那样说了！？\n感觉好过分——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1010_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0798f5e421bf329630b84106b00c4d20a326fb6475a5fa4cf357896ec366daca", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさ……", "zh": "大家辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "933e610c33f77c0d1eb9d15f9372064fd154d85e81ce931015a647b26d1132d4", "ja": "{$P$}さん聞いてください！\nエミリーちゃんにひどいこと言う人がいるんですよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生快听我说！\n有人对艾米莉说了很过分的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1013_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6cf737f20f2767119fe77342d132012162bd340f57319cca15bdb29f84453ea6", "ja": "ああ、それアタシ達も一緒だったんだよ。\nね、{$P$}。", "zh": "啊，那时候我们也是一起的。\n对吧，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8df724804f7761eee3df8e5f7e3786c55025bb34bb49bab1a9da575e8675f7c5", "ja": "うん。ご家族がフォローしてくれたんだけど、たまたま\n長い行列に並んで、イライラしていたそうだ。", "zh": "嗯。虽然后来家里人帮忙打圆场了，但好像是因为碰巧排了很久的队，心情很烦躁的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5c0b6c952822c03d79bd0f200579dc0235e5bc237fb8bf7ba35edb2d4492cb37", "ja": "そんなときに日本の魅力を宣伝されて、\nなにか言い返したくなったんだろうな。", "zh": "那种时候被人宣传日本的魅力，换作是谁都会想回嘴吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "edeffb27b73cefaa844f1b46f414dc5e3292761b0ac02549f6bea772af9429f4", "ja": "そんなの、ただの八つ当たりだぞ。\nエミリー、気にすることないからね！", "zh": "那只是迁怒而已。\n艾米莉，你不用放在心上哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "027c5ea52345557cd17f58a748d489e527e3e0f5bd333027e34220dc56ac5907", "ja": "そもそも、好きなものが一つで足りるわけないし。\n茜ちゃんも、プリンだけでは生きていけないのです！", "zh": "说到底，喜欢的东西怎么可能只有一样就够了嘛。\n小茜也不可能只靠布丁活下去哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "71ee196cf04f3a6398144866c0ea3b508077c7e9251b762d4ac3f4a3892bce27", "ja": "私も生クリーム好きだけど、ご飯もお好み焼きも\n大好きだもん。大丈夫だよ、エミリーちゃん♪", "zh": "我也喜欢鲜奶油，不过米饭和大阪烧我也都最喜欢了嘛。没关系哦，艾米莉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "ff9df13626d3faead81d4567bd30544ad950ddde210885114f43cbd39362d42d", "ja": "みなさん……。\nはい、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "大家……。\n嗯，非常感谢大家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7fca8fcee6dfb5f74ead15d086ef863c17dc970fa0c9a438183c949d9d8c690d", "ja": "（そう、故郷と言える場所も一つじゃなくていい。\nいつかエミリーの好きな場所すべてが、故郷に……）", "zh": "（没错，称得上故乡的地方不必只有一个。总有一天，艾米莉喜欢的所有地方，都能成为她的故乡……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "15e0e3bff1cd79f8045f00b7fdc0be67332e2e5655205b018708a69610b7ee61", "ja": "{$P$}、終わりそうな空気出してる\nけど、エミリーに話があるんじゃなかったの？", "zh": "{$P$}，你这副像是要结束了的样子，\n不过，你不是有话要跟艾米莉说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8bd1a6882485f1d64005152423e749066056ccc764906073917bbcb18be077fa", "ja": "あっ、そうだった！　ありがとうな、響。\n京都の着物工房からエミリーにオファーがあったんだ。", "zh": "啊，对了！谢谢你，响。\n京都的和服工坊向艾米莉发来了邀约。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "815b1f22dbf1ba3bfc4f0046971e9088ab466cb44b97ef8ea3f6d19ae28b09f7", "ja": "まぁ！　京の都から私に？", "zh": "哎呀！来自京都的邀请，是给我的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1026_p", "source_sha256": "44bbf3ed01bb070fddaccd567e7a3a642b7d3d0afa36b175d782bedf05634b0a", "ja": "日本の若者や海外の方向けに、着物の製作工程の動画を\n作るそうで、エミリーにレポーター役を頼みたいって。", "zh": "听说要为日本的年轻人和海外人士制作介绍和服制作过程的视频，想请艾米莉担任记者。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "81c2e5f45f554409cf0a91169dadc6f0d76f4a4c58f08b808726987f9348a2f0", "ja": "Wow！　もちろんお引き受けいたします！\nはあ～、なんて魅力的なご依頼なんでしょう♪", "zh": "Wow！我当然愿意接受！\n哈啊～这委托也太有吸引力了吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "ef567116fed29476345f93f086526615c45c3efa7224be14555b5639e1171b00", "ja": "あっ……。でも、海外の方向け……。\nあの、本当に、私でいいのでしょうか……？", "zh": "啊……可是，这是面向海外人士的……  \n那个，真的由我来可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a020e0f0c59ebf58cd3baf70f351c8a9c348615d71a503505c674c5271bedfbe", "ja": "……エミリー。好きなものは好き、でいいと思うよ。\nヘンなこと気にして、遠慮しない方がいいって！", "zh": "……艾米莉。我觉得喜欢什么就直说喜欢就好啦。\n不要顾虑那些乱七八糟的事，放开一点嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "699aa54f7f51b1312300cd035091b91d6134d737ba0cb337b7056af920f935d2", "ja": "歩さん……。", "zh": "步姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1031_p", "source_sha256": "d95b862b6a0cf5ed2db716a9d70380d84449f5d0fd258b604021b6a79eab26fe", "ja": "もちろん、気が進まないなら断ることもできる。\nでも先方は、エミリーにってオファーをくれたんだ。", "zh": "当然，如果你不太想去，也可以拒绝。\n不过对方可是点名给了艾米莉这次机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1032_p", "source_sha256": "ca50d7c6dbc9fdd4d95016fbe64e24d37bb9ee70c10b790224054551a14eb96f", "ja": "興味があるなら堂々と受けて、しっかりやり切れば\nいいんじゃないかな。後悔しないためにも。", "zh": "如果你感兴趣，就堂堂正正地接下，好好把它完成，不就好了吗？也是为了不让自己后悔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1033_032emi", "source_sha256": "15cf5f293f69d1cfa9d13ac2286bc0af2b5535e7f40b08043dad3d0079d746ee", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……。わかりました。\nあらためまして、そのお仕事、お引き受けいたします！", "zh": "制作人……我明白了。重新郑重地说一遍，我愿意接下那份工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "2bcaa9b9b7712e0b028d894b959f1bd2c0d7a0090893a08922afcd12e4168287", "ja": "いや～、よかったねエミリーちゃん！　前に着物屋さん\nの前を通りかかった時も、じーっと見てたもんね！", "zh": "哎呀～太好了呢，艾米莉！之前路过和服店门口时，你也一直盯着看呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "ff6ed1dd5fd129a29939f150e6d8f8b2b272c3cc15220035605d990e25300175", "ja": "はい！　私、ずっと見てみたかったんです。\nあの美しい反物は、どのように生み出されるのか……。", "zh": "是的！我一直都很想亲眼看看。\n那些美丽的和服布料究竟是怎样制作出来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1036_032emi", "source_sha256": "231e6607cafd9c94b6b87d5b900f57ae8ed0d563fe3877a8ca030fc99d35f1f8", "ja": "特に振り袖のように正装とされる着物は、細やかに意匠\nが凝らされたものばかりで、とっても素敵なんですよ♪", "zh": "尤其是像振袖这样被视为正装的和服，几乎每一件都经过了精巧的设计，真的非常漂亮呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_147_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_147_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "04ddb00542c0d452f605409beb65f26f57eda25ae1ef8c2784db75a258748475", "ja": "わぁ、なんだかすごそう……！\n{$P$}さん、私も行っていいですか！", "zh": "哇，感觉好厉害……！\n{$P$}先生，我也能去吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
